0,Aeta people - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Aeta_people,"Mag-antsi Aeta (also Mag-anchi or Magganchi) – Zambales, Tarlac, Pampanga.On May 31, 2022, 848 Aeta families belonging to the Ayta Mag-indi and Ayta Mag-antsi groups were issued their CADT by the NCIP, after the title was approved in 2009.","Ayta, Mag-antsi",Austronesian
