3,Antsi language,https://grokipedia.com/page/antsi_language,"The Antsi language, also known as Mag-antsi or Ayta Mag-antsi, is an endangered Sambalic language belonging to the Central Luzon branch of the Austronesian family, spoken primarily by the Ayta Mag-antsi indigenous people in the Philippines.","Ayta, Mag-antsi",Austronesian
